this feature, if it is used in a launch or experiment.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 Name => Str

The name of the experiment or launch.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Type => Str

This value is C<aws.evidently.splits> if this is an evaluation rule for
a launch, and it is C<aws.evidently.onlineab> if this is an evaluation
rule for an experiment.



